# Agent Instructions — {{ project_name }}

Use this file as the entry point for project-level coding rules and coordination conventions. It is the cross-tool conventions file (Codex/OpenCode/etc. read it natively; `CLAUDE.md` imports it for Claude Code). Tool-specific passages are labeled; everything unlabeled applies to every agent.

